+  // devices. This used to be signal(SIGBUS, SIG_IGN), which does not
+  // work for a synchronous signal: the kernel delivers it, SIG_IGN
+  // discards it, and the thread resumes at the same PC and faults
+  // again - forever, on any thread, for any SIGBUS in the process.
+  //
